{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/79f5f0c3fef26a2f8b249ffb7e4c6fca.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/629100fec5d09d20f0ed2caecc3e3e15.poster.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/629100fec5d09d20f0ed2caecc3e3e15.webm?t=1749034029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/96f554d1dfc96e71dbba9398c1e18a77.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yggdrasil, also known as &quot;The Tower of God&quot;, is a giant tower that reaches all the way to the clouds. It is commonly believed among explorers that weapons of all kinds can be found within the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a kind-hearted explorer named Mei rescues an armless man during a chance encounter. The man discovers that Mei had lost her memories while exploring the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having just realized her predicament, Mei yearns to discover the truth behind her amnesia. Fortunately, being a mage, the armless man Gilles senses their answer lies within Yggdrasil itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with her new ally, Mei embarks on her journey to explore Yggdrasil once more, aiming to reach the top of the tower and uncover the mystery of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Weapons to Collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Appearance with Collectable Outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Voiced Heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Mysteries of Yggdrasil</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1328900?t=1749034029","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749034029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749034029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749034029","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Explorer of Yggdrasil contains strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/79f5f0c3fef26a2f8b249ffb7e4c6fca.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/629100fec5d09d20f0ed2caecc3e3e15.poster.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/629100fec5d09d20f0ed2caecc3e3e15.webm?t=1749034029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/extras/96f554d1dfc96e71dbba9398c1e18a77.avif?t=1749034029\" width=620 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yggdrasil, also known as &quot;The Tower of God&quot;, is a giant tower that reaches all the way to the clouds. It is commonly believed among explorers that weapons of all kinds can be found within the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a kind-hearted explorer named Mei rescues an armless man during a chance encounter. The man discovers that Mei had lost her memories while exploring the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having just realized her predicament, Mei yearns to discover the truth behind her amnesia. Fortunately, being a mage, the armless man Gilles senses their answer lies within Yggdrasil itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with her new ally, Mei embarks on her journey to explore Yggdrasil once more, aiming to reach the top of the tower and uncover the mystery of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Weapons to Collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Appearance with Collectable Outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Voiced Heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Mysteries of Yggdrasil</p></li></ul>","developers":["Black Train"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1328900/header.jpg?t=1749034029","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura Games and Black Train, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.